{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ושלשת</b> Twice in the Masorah: ושלשת את גבול ארצך / ושלשת תרד מאד. Hinting at what they said: one who kills while descending goes into exile; one who kills while ascending does not go into exile. This is תרד — he killed him while descending, then ושלשת — he goes to the cities of refuge."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:02.251004204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}